## Interface: 16001
## Title: ProfessionsForever
## Notes: A replacement professions window for WoW: Forever that knows your bags, bank, mail and alts: a crafting queue, a shopping list with Auctionator pricing, a transfer planner, Disenchanting Mode and disenchant advice, recipe cooldowns, and navigation to vendors, trainers and bankers.
## Author: Thorgrim Lightfist - PvE
## X-Email: professionsforever@gmail.com
## X-License: GPL-3.0-only
## Version: 0.10.6
## Category: Professions
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ProfessionsForever\Media\icon
## SavedVariables: ProfessionsForeverDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ProfessionsForeverCharDB
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, Syndicator, TomTom, Polestar, Questie, QuestieDB, EllesmereUI, SkillUpForever
